   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "at-least-once -> idempotent consume",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "at-least-once -> idempotent consume",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t178336989",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 700.0,
   "y": 22,
   "width": 467.50000000000006,
   "height": 21.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1d1d1d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1920387803,
   "versionNonce": 1200324016,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "the dual-write hazard vs. the transactional outbox",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "the dual-write hazard vs. the transactional outbox",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 17
  },
  {
   "id": "t97152753",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 262,
   "width": 986.1500000000001,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#555555",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 78950972,
   "versionNonce": 1700930804,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A crash, a client timeout, or a pod reschedule in the gap between the two writes leaves one system updated and the other not: nothing is watching for the mismatch.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "A crash, a client timeout, or a pod reschedule in the gap between the two writes leaves one system updated and the other not: nothing is watching for the mismatch.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t1459049288",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 278,
   "width": 1028.5,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#555555",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1369165784,
   "versionNonce": 1907250244,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Reversing the order (publish, then save) relocates the same gap; it does not close it. No sequencing of two independent writes to two independent systems closes this gap.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Reversing the order (publish, then save) relocates the same gap; it does not close it. No sequencing of two independent writes to two independent systems closes this gap.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t1400938808",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 745,
   "width": 919.6,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#555555",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 653427887,
   "versionNonce": 1908269012,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The second hop (table to broker) is still separate: but now explicit, bounded, and owned by one piece of infrastructure, not buried in application code.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The second hop (table to broker) is still separate: but now explicit, bounded, and owned by one piece of infrastructure, not buried in application code.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t401619222",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 761,
   "width": 901.45,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#555555",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1993944213,
   "versionNonce": 1554083417,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "At-least-once delivery out of the relay is only safe because the consumer on the far side is idempotent (check-then-insert, deduped by aggregate id).",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "At-least-once delivery out of the relay is only safe because the consumer on the far side is idempotent (check-then-insert, deduped by aggregate id).",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
